More gearing at the back and you

00:23:49.170 --> 00:23:51.880
turn the handle and everything

00:23:51.880 --> 00:23:54.010
goes round all

00:23:54.060 --> 00:23:56.300
geared together in quite sophisticated

00:23:56.300 --> 00:23:58.610
clockwork. It was designed

00:23:58.610 --> 00:23:59.970
he believes as a computer

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:03.560
to show the varying cycles of the moon, sun, and planets.

00:24:04.010 --> 00:24:06.050
A device that by all previous knowledge

00:24:06.050 --> 00:24:09.190
simply ought not to have existed for another 2,000 years.

00:24:09.740 --> 00:24:13.160
Its maker had perfected a system of differential gearing.

00:24:13.960 --> 00:24:15.460
When Professor Price discovered this,

00:24:15.600 --> 00:24:17.440
he had found a unique demonstration

00:24:17.440 --> 00:24:19.320
of the lost wisdom of the ancients.

00:24:20.230 --> 00:24:23.430
It is just incredible that the Greeks could invent

00:24:23.430 --> 00:24:25.910
this principle of the differential gear.

00:24:26.590 --> 00:24:29.530
It is so complicated that it contains...

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:36.100
in essence, all of the line that led right through to modern clockwork, to the computer,

00:24:36.420 --> 00:24:42.360
and indeed to the machine age, and everything that distinguishes our civilization from everything

00:24:42.360 --> 00:24:49.330
that went before. And the whole line began right here with this one unique relic.

00:24:51.160 --> 00:24:56.050
The Antikythera computer and the Baghdad battery, if indeed it is a battery,

00:24:56.780 --> 00:24:59.970
represent two of the great ifs of history, because...

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:06.760
they're 2,000 years ahead of their time. If the societies that produce them had

00:25:06.760 --> 00:25:14.320
continued to develop their technologies, by now it would be 4,000 AD. By this time

00:25:14.320 --> 00:25:19.870
we would not merely have sent a few men to the moon, we would have colonized all

00:25:19.870 --> 00:25:22.270
the stars visible to the naked eye.

00:25:56.010 --> 00:25:58.730
Next week, the search for the world's missing ape men.
